{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "1stact_level_a001_03_beg",
  "groupId": "1stact",
  "stageId": "a001_03",
  "title": "An Unexpected Journey",
  "storyCode": "GT-3",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "803b1ded5be79baba4fb40684675533b0df6bc5b4ec3364b688f4191fbad274e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bounty Hunter",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ngh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bounty Hunter",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You... you took out all my buddies?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bounty Hunter",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...S-stay away from me! I'm begging you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bounty Hunter",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I, I'll give you all my coins! My weapons! Anything you want..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where's the girl?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bounty Hunter",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What are you talking about...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bounty Hunter",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't come any closer...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bounty Hunter",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You monster—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Clear \\ Visibility: 14 km\nForest at the foot of Mt. Terrat"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This rock..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Stay close to me, you two. Watch your step, and stay inside my footprints. Don't go around touching things either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm afraid this forest is even more dangerous than we suspected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is something carved on that rock?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "These are marks left behind by bounty hunters. We need to take heed of these, or we may well end up stepping in a trap."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So, how are we going to avoid the traps?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just watch me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "An animal trap on a rope... how old-fashioned."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here's a rolling log trap, hidden by the foliage. Would've tripped it if we rushed forward."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Miss Carol, watch your step."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Uh, huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you take another step in that direction, there's probably a spiked pitfall waiting for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You sure are the real deal. You're pretty good at this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course. After all, I used to..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's not realistic to go around all the traps. Looks like we'll have to disarm some of them after all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The most perilous path for them will soon become the safest path for us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's go."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Something's not right here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is it a trap?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A symbol drawn with blood..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'...Monster?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's the meaning of this? In all my years, I've never seen a symbol like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Oh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is this what I think it is..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bounty Hunter",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Monster... Monster!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bounty Hunter",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "D-don't come this way!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It was you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Skadi, you're Skadi, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...So, the chief of Dewville was with you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh? You know Carol...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hand her over to me. Now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Grani, something's not right about her eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can't just do that. Let's talk this over peacefully—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "H-huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oww!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That was just a warning."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No! Miss Carol, Big Bob..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wh-why would she attack you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You know each other right, so why—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No time to explain! Run for it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*gasp* *gasp*... Is she still after us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "G-Grani... I, I can't run for any longer..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That woman... is she really a monster? She's not even short of breath!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why must I waste my time on you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She's really gonna kill me! Whoa, what is she doing to Miss Carol?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Carol",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Her eyes, they're so red... G-Grani!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, no, no! This can't be happening!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Stop!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ambush!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Captain'",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now! Fiiire!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Captain'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's her right there, the walking Catastrophe! Hurry, shoot her down!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Stop it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Captain'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What do you think you're doing, kid?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't know why she's after us, but she's still my coworker!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "'Captain'",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "G-get out of my way, you rascal—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grani",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hurry up and run!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Big Bob",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "—There's an opening to the east! Hurry!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bounty Hunter",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No way we're letting you escape! Die, monster!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Skadi",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Ægirian) Scatter and fall!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
